notes.content:
[b][Update][/b]
~After entering the corresponding chapter from the chapter selection, the notebook only retains the evidence available for the current chapter, without affecting the storyline;

[b][Fix]:[/b]
~Fixed the bug where evidence in the presentation system was not displayed (if a player saved at the presentation, reading the save would roll back the storyline a bit);
~Fixed the bug where some evidence in the notebook was not displayed;
~Fixed some text errors;

First of all, we want to say thank you to every player who has been with us in the group. Thank you for staying with us and helping us improve and optimize the game. We have also noticed the valuable opinions and shortcomings raised in the comments area. We have summarized and optimized these feedbacks.

Finally, please comment on the community forum or share your ideas with us through the official Q group <476848563>. 

We will listen to every player and respond as best we can.

We look forward to working with you to make the game more perfect and better.

[b][Update]:[/b]
~Added new achievement: Welcome to Yuanxiang Village;
~Added a feature to automatically exit investigation after the on-site investigation ends (no need for the player to manually exit);

[b][In-Game]:[/b]
~Removed the remaining "Important options, please save promptly" prompt;
~Removed incorrect plot lines remaining in the "Credits";
~Removed the residual Zhao Hong and Hu Alv after the "Continue Playing" storyline;
~Fixed the issue where "Notebook" content was missing after entering from chapter selection;
~Changed rendering methods to try to solve in-game stuttering issues;
~Fixed the bug where the special achievement in Chapter 5 would not pop up;
